### Companion IoT — register device (iot-register)
### 1) Obtenha JWT:
###    curl -s "{{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password" \
###      -H "apikey: {{anonKey}}" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
###      -d '{"email":"...","password":"..."}'
### 2) Cole access_token em @userJwt abaixo.
### 3) Send Request (REST Client extension).

@supabaseUrl = https://zlsrurqfkhspwbzmqimp.supabase.co
@anonKey = REPLACE_WITH_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
@userJwt = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Register ESP32
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/functions/v1/iot-register
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "mesa"
}

###
### Presence smoke (após salvar deviceKey da resposta)
### POST {{supabaseUrl}}/functions/v1/iot-presence
### X-Device-Key: REPLACE_WITH_DEVICE_KEY
### Content-Type: application/json
###
### {
###   "rssi": -60
### }
